---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms and Conditions" description="Terms and conditions of use of the Arango Dental Clinic website: informational nature of the content, appointment requests, prices and liability.">

  <!-- ── Header ── -->
  <section class="lgl-hero">
    <div class="lgl-container">
      <p class="lgl-label">Arango Dental Clinic</p>
      <h1 class="lgl-hero-title">Terms and Conditions</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Content ── -->
  <section class="lgl-content-section">
    <div class="lgl-container lgl-prose">

      <p class="lgl-note">
        <em>This is a courtesy translation of the Spanish version; in case of any discrepancy, the Spanish version prevails.</em>
        <a href="/terminos-condiciones/" hreflang="es" lang="es">Read the Spanish version</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Purpose</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms and Conditions govern access to and use of the website arangodentalclinic.es, owned by
        Arango Dental Clinic (hereinafter, "the Clinic"), whose full identification details are set out in the
        <a href="/en/legal-notice/">Legal Notice</a>. Accessing and using the Website gives you the status of
        user and implies acceptance of these Terms and Conditions.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Informational nature of the Website</h2>
      <p>
        The information on this Website, including the descriptions of dental services and treatments, is for
        general information only. It does not constitute a diagnosis, a prescription or a recommendation for
        individual treatment. All dental treatment requires a prior in-person assessment by a registered
        professional.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Appointment requests</h2>
      <p>
        Requesting an appointment through the form, by phone or on WhatsApp does not mean it is automatically
        confirmed. An appointment is only confirmed when the Clinic expressly tells the user so. The Clinic
        reserves the right to reschedule appointments for justified reasons, informing the patient as far in
        advance as possible.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Prices</h2>
      <p>
        Any guideline prices that may be shown on the Website are for information only and are subject to an
        individual assessment after the in-person consultation. The final quote will be given in writing before
        any treatment begins.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The content of the Website is protected by intellectual and industrial property rights owned by Arango
        Dental Clinic or by third-party licensors, on the terms described in the
        <a href="/en/legal-notice/">Legal Notice</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>6. User's responsibility</h2>
      <p>
        The user agrees to use the Website and its contact forms diligently, providing truthful information, and
        not to use them for fraudulent or unlawful purposes or in a way that is contrary to these Terms and
        Conditions.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        Arango Dental Clinic will not be liable for any damage or loss arising from improper use of the Website,
        from its unavailability, or from decisions taken by the user on the basis of the general information on
        the Website without having had the corresponding in-person professional consultation.
      </p>

      <h2>8. External links</h2>
      <p>
        The Website may contain links to social networks and other third-party websites (Facebook, Instagram,
        WhatsApp, Google Maps, etc.). Arango Dental Clinic does not control and is not responsible for the
        content of those sites.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to the terms</h2>
      <p>
        Arango Dental Clinic may modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. Changes will be published on
        this same page, stating the date of the last update.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Applicable law and jurisdiction</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms and Conditions are governed by Spanish law. Any dispute will be submitted to the courts
        that have jurisdiction under the applicable consumer and user protection regulations.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, you can contact us at
        <a href="mailto:Arangodentalclinic@gmail.com">Arangodentalclinic@gmail.com</a> or on
        <a href="tel:+34965088282">+34 965 08 82 82</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="lgl-updated">Last updated: 22 August 2026</p>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .lgl-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 2rem;
    padding-right: 2rem;
  }

  /* ── Header ── */
  .lgl-hero {
    background-color: #0d2219;
    padding: 8rem 0 3.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  :global(html.dark) .lgl-hero {
    background-color: #0d2219;
  }

  .lgl-label {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #C49B38;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  :global(html.dark) .lgl-label {
    color: #D4AF55;
  }

  .lgl-hero-title {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(244, 240, 235, 0.95);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Prose ── */
  .lgl-content-section {
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    padding: 4.5rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .lgl-prose {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .lgl-prose h2 {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .lgl-prose h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .lgl-prose p {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }

  .lgl-prose ul {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .lgl-prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .lgl-prose a {
    color: var(--teal-600);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .lgl-updated {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-primary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .lgl-prose .lgl-note {
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold-500);
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
  }
</style>
